id: god-of-judgment
name: God of Judgment
optionOf: divine-magic
description: An Energy Charge on the attack, when you use the Signature Technique Maneuver.
text: >
  God of Judgment [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use the Signature Technique Maneuver, apply an Energy Charge to that
  Attacking Maneuver.

---

# Armed from the Traits tab: the next Signature Technique declared gets its Energy Charge.
[triggered/declare-maneuver, 1/round]
requires signatureTechnique;
attack.energyCharges += 1;
